Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.50,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,TONOME DETECTIVE AGENCY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Please, feel free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:24.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How did you know it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.81,0:00:27.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I thought you couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:31.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can smell you, Tonome-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:35.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Not to say that you stink or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:37.66,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:43.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,B-Because I can't see, my auditory and \Nolfactory perception are better than most!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:50.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You must have a very keen\N sense of smell indeed, Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:52.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can't detect my own odor at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:55.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Right! I didn't mean to say it was bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:01.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's nice to know that I have my own scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:09.15,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:12.91,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san, where am I right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:30.29,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're right here, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:36.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I think you're the only person \Nwho could ever find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:39.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's got my heart racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.35,0:01:41.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:49.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you join me for dinner this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you have any preferences?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:57.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Western, Chinese, Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Anything's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:02.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Any allergies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:03.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:07.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Then do you have a favorite restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:14.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well... I don't eat out often, \Nso I just go to the usual places.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:17.42,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'd be happy with wherever you recommend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:22.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Good. There's actually somewhere \NI've been wanting to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:26.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds great!\NLet's do it! Let's go there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.26,0:02:28.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Then let us be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:31.62,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please take my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:39.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm going to start walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:40.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:53.42,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? The rhythm of his gait is off...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:55.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is something bothering him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:03:00.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me he didn't really\N have a place in mind after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:06.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonome-san, I'm sorry I didn't have \Na preference and put it all on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.69,0:03:07.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:08.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is there a direction that \Nsmells especially delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:17.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:19.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:24.07,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was worried it might not be to your taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:27.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.51,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:32.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can't wait to try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, neither can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:40.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's my first time here, so I went \Nwith the house's recommendations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:44.93,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've never smelled anything like it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Quite an adventure, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:47.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It certainly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:54.61,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,This... vegetable, is it? It's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:56.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's probably coriander.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:04.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,This is my first time eating out\N with someone from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:05.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:07.93,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was just thinking how nice—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.72,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's got my heart racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:15.00,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you join me for dinner this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:20.47,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was so fixated on how I've never \Ndone this before, I didn't realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:23.45,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would this count as a date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:27.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}But he didn't call it that,\N so maybe it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:28.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:31.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This is delicious too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll put it on your plate at, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:35.91,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Twelve o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:37.56,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:41.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.15,0:04:47.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, no. This is just my first time \Ndining alone with a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:51.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was thinking, "Gosh,\N it's almost like a date..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That was the intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Does that make you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.47,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Well, you could say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:05:01.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I got into my own head about it.\N How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:07.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san, let me see your hands a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:15.86,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm invisible, so it's hard \Nfor most people to tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:21.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but I thought you might be able \Nto feel it, even through my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:30.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't want you thinking you're \Nthe only one who's nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:33.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, your heart's pounding too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:35.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I hope you won't spread it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:39.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Wasn't that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:41.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad it turned out to be a nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:44.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I totally agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:47.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Now, please take my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.70,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll guide you to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:58.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}My heart's still racing from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:06.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be safer if you held on tighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:10.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No! I've got my cane too, \Nso I can work it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.51,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.51,0:06:16.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm not repulsed or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:19.33,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's just... you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:23.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's the opposite, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:28.29,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, are you grinning at me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:29.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh? You could tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:32.21,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You could hardly hide it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I would never hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:38.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'd prefer that you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:45.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,In fact, I feel like skipping right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How about you? Want to skip with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:49.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And you shouldn't skip either!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ah, a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:59.66,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll restrain myself \Nand escort you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:02.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.33,0:07:33.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,D-Did things actually go r-really \Nwell with Tonome-san today?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:33.45,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,TONOME & YAKO
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:37.84,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,The bath is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Guess I'll take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:48.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonome-san, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:50.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since we first spoke at my interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:54.30,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,he's always seemed so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:07:58.42,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}His voice and the way he \Nspeaks are so soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:04.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can hear how elegantly he carries himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:12.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't help feeling how \Nwonderful of a person he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:16.11,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, stop! You only went \Nto dinner together once!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:17.77,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't get ahead of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:24.33,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder what Tonome-san thinks of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:27.57,Flashback - Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'd prefer that you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.14,0:08:31.19,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:32.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:36.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonome-san is an invisible man, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:41.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Invisible" meaning that people \Ncan't see him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:46.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}So even sighted people can't see him?\N I wonder how that feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:48.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:55.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, do you wish I could see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:57.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,See me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't really think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:04.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's invisible, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:08.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you wish you could see me, Yako-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:17.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can tell what kind of person you are, \Nso I think that's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:27.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get it now. Tonome-san doesn't \Nneed me to see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:48.60,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That was close, Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.27,0:09:50.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.09,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You aren't hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:53.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:56.89,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my bicycle...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:58.13,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:02.27,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,TONOME DETECTIVE AGENCY
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:04.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, we handle a variety of investigations,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:07.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,including missing persons \Nand background checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.31,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes. Would you like an appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:14.65,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll call back after \Nwe confirm the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:17.39,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:22.86,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,There's a wall here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:24.58,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Who're you calling a wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:25.78,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I'm so tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.78,0:10:27.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Kikira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.61,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You're in the way. Five steps back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.21,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You can pass now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.46,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I put your coffee to the right\N of your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:43.31,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:44.64,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,So tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:54.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san. Kikira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:59.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,There's nothing strange about \Nmy appearance, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:00.67,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:04.22,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, what's this? \NYou trying to impress someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:07.97,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You look great today, Shizuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:10.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,If you need to talk romance, I'm your girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:11.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:15.69,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Look at you blushing, you cutie-pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:17.87,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You're loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:20.61,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah?! I don't wanna hear it from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:21.73,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,So tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:26.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I touch your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:33.03,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,He wants to touch my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:38.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Er, or would you rather I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,G-Go ahead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:47.02,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I can feel Tonome-san's hand getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:51.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,There, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,There was a cherry petal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:56.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's spring for you, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.79,0:12:01.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm embarrassed by how nervous that made me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:05.31,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Wait, is who you're into...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:10.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,T-Tonome-san! It's time\N for consultations, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:11.38,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:11.64,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:13.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I've got all the materials!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.70,0:12:15.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.22,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,So tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Could you give me the details?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:24.27,Main,Tanuki Girl,0,0,0,,He's always been a bit of a ladies' man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:27.11,Main,Tanuki Girl,0,0,0,,Before we get married, I want \Nto make sure he's being faithful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:31.09,Main,Dog Man,0,0,0,,I mean it! I saw a meowing frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:35.46,Main,Cyclops Wife,0,0,0,,He's totally cheating on me! And thinks\N I don't notice him sneaking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please, uh... tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.38,Main,Shaggy 1,0,0,0,,Lifespan: 80,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:41.84,Main,Shaggy 2,0,0,0,,Born alongside the Milky Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.47,Main,Shaggy 3,0,0,0,,Skilled at generating planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:45.03,Main,Shaggy 4,0,0,0,,Capable of interstellar travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.03,0:12:50.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I-I really just need your missing \Ndaughter's physical description.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:51.97,Main,Shaggy 4,0,0,0,,Pupil diameter: 5 millimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:53.46,Main,Shaggy 3,0,0,0,,Appendage length: 1 centimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.35,Main,Shaggy 2,0,0,0,,Lip moisture: 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.35,0:12:56.56,Main,Shaggy 1,0,0,0,,Strong teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:02.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I wrote that all down, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:06.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's rather hard to differentiate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:08.17,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I wonder if we'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:11.31,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Just look for someone who looks \Nexactly like them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:26.35,Main,Delivery,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:27.82,Main,Delivery,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:38.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some things are easy for an invisible man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:43.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Returned straight to work \Nafter sales calls today...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Now I'll just wait until closi—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:56.29,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Things aren't always easy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:02.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,for an invisible man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:15.74,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you grinning about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:16.86,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Tonome again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:19.03,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What? N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:20.93,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was listening to a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.95,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Listening... to a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:26.65,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, a recording of someone narrating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:28.76,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:30.90,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Would you like to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:35.62,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:38.45,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've been into romances lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:43.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,They go on a dinner date, \Nand then because of a rose, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:43.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:46.84,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a romance story?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:49.92,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you can make all that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:51.61,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I don't even know what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:55.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I became a keen listener when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:59.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But Jarashi... You're an \Nanimal person, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:04.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A book said that you had \Ngood senses of hearing and smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:08.22,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not great at that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:11.36,Flashback,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here, Tonome? Didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:14.28,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not even fully invisible right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:16.71,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I could probably do better \Nif I really focused, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:19.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, when you're locked in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:24.39,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've heard about that from Tonome-san \Nand Kikira-san's investigation reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:27.29,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You got any problems going on, Shizuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:30.66,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,When I'm locked in, I can take down anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:33.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You don't have to take anyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:34.97,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But could I borrow your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:43.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,This receipt... I can read \Nall of it except the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.12,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Lemme see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:52.73,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, this receipt's really worn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:58.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Ah, that does happen sometimes. \NWhat does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:15:59.69,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It says 1,600 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:01.53,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thanks a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:08.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And the product on the receipt is an \Neconomy-size pack of animal person Churuns...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:11.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did you buy them, Jarashi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:12.77,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:18.03,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I happened to see them while \NI was guarding a client.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.23,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,NOW ON SALE!! ADVERTISED PRODUCT\N ECONOMY-SIZED ANIMAL PERSON CHURUNS
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:20.93,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It was a huge bargain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:24.57,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Please don't spend company funds on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.65,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,What, is that not allowed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:30.67,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Well, sorry. They don't \Nmake Churuns for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:32.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:34.48,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! I've gotta get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:37.99,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:41.24,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I left your phone and earphones \Non the left side of your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:42.46,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:43.93,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Take care now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:45.50,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's awfully late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:57.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonome-san's been gone awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:00.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought he'd be back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Tonome-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.66,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Huh? No one's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:11.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.53,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Yako, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:15.53,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.40,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Shizuka, where'd you get hurt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.46,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:22.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:24.13,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,C'mon! Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:26.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm not hurt! I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:30.55,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,MEETING ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:33.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:37.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san brought a first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:41.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're the one who needs it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:46.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I suppose I can't fully hide \Nmyself when you're around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I ran into a bit of trouble today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:54.29,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was making my report on the \Ninfidelity investigation, when...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:01.54,Flashback,Cyclops Wife,0,0,0,,You louse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:03.79,Flashback,Cyclops Wife,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.73,Flashback,Cyclops Husband,0,0,0,,I can't believe you set a detective on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.58,Flashback,Cyclops Wife,0,0,0,,You're turning this on {\i1}me{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:09.74,Flashback,Cyclops Husband,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sneaky little—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:10.97,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,N-Now, please, calm down...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:11.83,Flashback,Cyclops Wife,0,0,0,,Stay outta this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:12.43,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:16.39,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I tried to interfere and got myself hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:19.61,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But... how bad was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:24.14,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Not bad. The client calmed down, \Nso things went smoothly after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:28.13,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Everyone seemed surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:31.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,that fluids cease being invisible \Nonce they leave my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:35.76,Flashback,Cyclops Wife,0,0,0,,Wow! Invisible people bleed too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:37.95,Flashback,Cyclops Husband,0,0,0,,Never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They couldn't believe their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:44.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was asking how bad your injury was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.95,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:51.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let me be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:58.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Since the damage is invisible, \NI can't see the extent of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:02.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's not especially bad, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:04.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It just bled more than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:06.29,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:09.15,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But if you bleed too much, you could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.15,0:19:10.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not bleeding that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:14.43,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-Isn't there anything I can do to help?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:16.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, if you're offering...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:21.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I want to tape down the gauze. \NHold it down for me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:21.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:29.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't know why. I didn't \Nwant you to worry about me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:33.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but this makes me feel strangely \Npleased. Almost ticklish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:39.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Did that tickle?! \NWas I holding the gauze wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:43.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm naturally ticklish, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:45.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Want me to tickle you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:47.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:54.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, everyone's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:57.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I guess we're past office hours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Will you be leaving too, Yako-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:01.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.65,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, I've got to write up my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:06.49,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So you'll be staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Indeed, this has put me behind on work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:12.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And I'm not hurt badly enough to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.05,0:20:16.86,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words, \Nhe'll be working overtime again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:20.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}And probably without a single break...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:24.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'll order some supplies, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:26.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, don't put yourself out, Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.47,0:20:30.06,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:35.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,when I'm done, \Nwe could take a break together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:39.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, let's take a break together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:42.03,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Huh? I thought you had work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:44.37,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can work after.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.29,0:20:49.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Good work today, Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:51.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I made you some tea. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:54.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is this a new tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:59.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's an herbal blend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.16,0:21:01.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was curious about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:04.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It has such a lovely aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.77,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.19,0:21:11.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:15.11,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonome-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:18.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}He invited me out to dinner before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:21.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was that a one-time thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:28.06,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd love to go on another...\Ndate... with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:32.14,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then why don't I just invite him out myself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:34.47,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what if he says no?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:37.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, it's important to be brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.95,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san, by the way—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:42.89,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Would you like to join me for dinner tonight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:49.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What's the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:54.26,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, can we make another \Nreservation after that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:22:01.95,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I found a place where you can make your own \Ntea blend and wanted to invite you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:04.86,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,R-Reservation made!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.73,0:22:07.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.05,0:22:10.07,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 1:THE SOON-TO-BE COUPLE\NTO BE CONTINUED
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.37,0:22:09.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's pick a day first.
